<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %> — AptitudePro</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #1e40af;
            --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
            --accent: #3b82f6;
            --bg-dark: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background: #090d16;
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .navbar {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 16px 32px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand-link {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #60a5fa;
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .placement-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .page-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .page-header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #93c5fd);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .page-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .disclaimer-banner {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #93c5fd;
        }

        .disclaimer-banner i {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #60a5fa;
        }

        .alert-error {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #fca5a5;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        /* CARD GRIDS */
        .path-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .path-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 32px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .path-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .path-icon-wrapper {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2), rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.1));
            border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #60a5fa;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .path-card h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .path-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .path-features {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0 0 28px 0;
        }

        .path-features li {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .path-features li i {
            color: #34d399;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
        }

        /* COMPANY GRID */
        .company-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .company-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .company-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            border-color: #60a5fa;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .company-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .company-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .company-name {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .company-tag {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .cognizant-sections { display:grid; gap:10px; margin-top:16px; }
        .cognizant-section-row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:12px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09); border-radius:10px; background:rgba(2,6,23,.25); }
        .cognizant-section-row span { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px; }
        .cognizant-section-row small { color:#94a3b8; }
        .cognizant-section-row .btn-primary { white-space:nowrap; }
        @media(max-width:560px){.cognizant-section-row{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.cognizant-section-row .btn-primary{width:100%;justify-content:center}}

        /* LEVEL CARDS */
        .level-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .level-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 28px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
        }

        .level-card.locked {
            opacity: 0.6;
            filter: grayscale(40%);
        }

        .level-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        .level-badge.unlocked {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: #34d399;
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }

        .level-badge.locked-tag {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            color: #fca5a5;
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }

        .level-card h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .level-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .breadcrumb {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .breadcrumb a {
            color: #60a5fa;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .breadcrumb a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .back-bar {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .btn-back {
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* TCS MOCK HERO BANNER & RESTRUCTURED CARDS */
        .tcs-placement-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 28px;
        }

        .tcs-mock-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.8), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95));
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 32px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .tcs-hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            color: #60a5fa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .tcs-hero-content h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .tcs-hero-content p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
            max-width: 650px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .tcs-meta-pills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .tcs-pill {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .btn-tcs-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 28px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .btn-tcs-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #2563eb);
        }

        .tcs-card-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .tcs-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 28px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .tcs-card.locked {
            opacity: 0.65;
            filter: grayscale(30%);
        }

        .tcs-card-header {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .tcs-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .tcs-badge.unlocked {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: #34d399;
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }

        .tcs-badge.locked-tag {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            color: #fca5a5;
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }

        .tcs-card h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .tcs-card-stats {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .tcs-card-desc {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }

        .tcs-section-breakdown {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .tcs-breakdown-item {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .tcs-breakdown-item:hover {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.2);
        }

        .tcs-sec-icon {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            color: #60a5fa;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .tcs-sec-info {
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .tcs-sec-info strong {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #f8fafc;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .tcs-sec-info small {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .tcs-mini-btn {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
            color: #60a5fa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 12px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .tcs-mini-btn:hover:not(.disabled) {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .tcs-mini-btn.disabled {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: #64748b;
            border-color: transparent;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .tcs-mock-hero {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
            .btn-tcs-primary {
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }
    /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
           Company-module component styles.
           The rules above define the canonical vocabulary
           (.tcs-card-grid / .tcs-card / .tcs-badge / .tcs-sec-*).
           The rules below add the remaining building blocks used by the
           company modules (hero actions, section headers, card CTAs) so that
           those pages render as designed instead of falling back to raw HTML.
           ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

        .tcs-hero-actions,
        .tcs-hero-action {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .tcs-hero-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 14px 26px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #ffffff;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .tcs-hero-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.5);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .tcs-btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #3b82f6);
            border-color: transparent;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .tcs-btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        }

        /* Section heading used between groups of cards */
        .tcs-section-header {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .tcs-section-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .tcs-section-header h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        }

        .tcs-section-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 18px 0;
            max-width: 760px;
        }

        /* Card internals */
        .tcs-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .tcs-card-icon {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .tcs-card-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .tcs-card-title {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .tcs-card-subtitle {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .tcs-card-meta {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .tcs-card-meta span {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .tcs-card-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #ffffff;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .tcs-card-btn:hover {
            filter: brightness(1.12);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .tcs-card-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        /* Make sure anchors never render as raw blue underlined links */
        .tcs-placement-wrapper a {
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* ── Aliases ──────────────────────────────────────────
           The company modules historically used a second set of names for the
           same components. Aliasing them keeps every existing page rendering
           with the intended card / grid styling. */
        .tcs-cards-grid,
        .tcs-practice-card,
        .tcs-card-grid .tcs-practice-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .tcs-cards-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .tcs-practice-card {
            padding: 28px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .tcs-practice-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .tcs-practice-card .tcs-card-title {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .tcs-practice-card .tcs-card-desc {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
        }

        .tcs-practice-card .tcs-card-btn {
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        /* Legacy single-column variants used by the coding / writing cards */
        .tcs-cards-grid[style*="grid-template-columns: 1fr"] {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        /* FULLSCREEN & WIDE-VIEW CONTROLS */
        .btn-fullscreen-toggle {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            color: #93c5fd;
            border-radius: 9px;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .btn-fullscreen-toggle:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
            border-color: #60a5fa;
            color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-fullscreen-toggle.active {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff;
            border-color: #60a5fa;
        }

        .fullscreen-fab-container {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 24px;
            right: 24px;
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .btn-floating-fab {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e40af, #3b82f6);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 17px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 16px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .btn-floating-fab:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
            border-color: #93c5fd;
        }

        /* FLUID EXPANSION IN FULLSCREEN / WIDE-MODE */
        :fullscreen body,
        body:-webkit-full-screen {
            background: #090d16;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        :fullscreen .placement-container,
        body:-webkit-full-screen .placement-container,
        body.fullscreen-active .placement-container,
        .placement-container.wide-mode {
            max-width: 96vw;
            margin: 24px auto;
            padding: 0 28px;
            transition: max-width 0.3s ease;
        }

        :fullscreen .company-grid,
        body:-webkit-full-screen .company-grid,
        body.fullscreen-active .company-grid,
        .placement-container.wide-mode .company-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 22px;
        }

        :fullscreen .company-card,
        body:-webkit-full-screen .company-card,
        body.fullscreen-active .company-card,
        .placement-container.wide-mode .company-card {
            padding: 26px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="brand-link">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> AptitudePro
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <button type="button" id="btnToggleWidth" class="btn-fullscreen-toggle" title="Toggle Full Width Mode">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-left-right-to-line" id="widthIcon"></i>
                <span id="widthText">Full Width</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" id="btnToggleFullscreen" class="btn-fullscreen-toggle" title="Toggle Full Screen (or press F)">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-expand" id="fullscreenIcon"></i>
                <span id="fullscreenText">Full Screen</span>
            </button>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="nav-link"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i> Dashboard</a>
            <a href="/results/history" class="nav-link"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i> History</a>
            <a href="/logout" class="nav-link"><i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket"></i> Logout</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="placement-container">

        <% if (error) { %>
            <div class="alert-error">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
                <span><%= error %></span>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <% if (step === 'main-choice') { %>
            <!-- STEP 1: MAIN LEARNING PATH SELECTION -->
            <div class="page-header">
                <h1>Choose Your Learning Path</h1>
                <p>Select your education tier to experience tailored aptitude tests and placement preparation.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="path-grid">
                <!-- SCHOOL STUDENTS CARD -->
                <div class="path-card">
                    <div>
                        <div class="path-icon-wrapper">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-graduate"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>School Students</h2>
                        <p>Build strong fundamental aptitude skills through a single combined practice test.</p>
                        <ul class="path-features">
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 25 Mixed Questions per test</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Mathematics + Logical + English</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 3 Separate Difficulty Levels</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> No subject selection required</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/placement/school" class="btn-primary">
                        <span>Start Learning</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- COLLEGE STUDENTS & PLACEMENT CARD -->
                <div class="path-card">
                    <div>
                        <div class="path-icon-wrapper">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>College & Placement Preparation</h2>
                        <p>Prepare for campus recruitment drives, competitive aptitude exams, and company assessments.</p>
                        <ul class="path-features">
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> General Placement Aptitude</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Practice by Company (TCS, Infosys, etc.)</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Quant, Logical, Verbal & Problem Solving</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Foundation, Intermediate & Advanced</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/placement/college" class="btn-primary">
                        <span>Explore Placement</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        <% } else if (step === 'school-levels') { %>
            <!-- STEP 2A: SCHOOL LEVELS -->
            <div class="back-bar">
                <a href="/placement" class="btn-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left"></i> Back to Path Selection</a>
            </div>

            <div class="page-header">
                <h1>School Aptitude Test</h1>
                <p>Combined practice test featuring Mathematics, Logical Reasoning & English questions.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="level-grid">
                <% levels.forEach(function(lvl) { %>
                    <div class="level-card <%= lvl.unlocked ? '' : 'locked' %>">
                        <div>
                            <div class="level-badge <%= lvl.unlocked ? 'unlocked' : 'locked-tag' %>">
                                <i class="fa-solid <%= lvl.unlocked ? 'fa-lock-open' : 'fa-lock' %>"></i>
                                <span><%= lvl.unlocked ? 'Unlocked' : 'Locked' %></span>
                            </div>
                            <h3><%= lvl.label.full %></h3>
                            <p><%= lvl.label.tagline %>. 25 mixed aptitude questions automatically selected from the Level <%= lvl.number %> question pool.</p>
                        </div>
                        <% if (lvl.unlocked) { %>
                            <a href="/quiz?learningPath=school&difficulty=<%= lvl.number %>" class="btn-primary">
                                <span>Start Level <%= lvl.number %> Test</span>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>
                            </a>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <button class="btn-secondary" disabled>
                                <span>Score <%= unlockThreshold %>% on Level <%= lvl.number - 1 %> to Unlock</span>
                            </button>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                <% }); %>
            </div>

        <% } else if (step === 'college-choice') { %>
            <!-- STEP 2B: COLLEGE CHOICE -->
            <div class="back-bar">
                <a href="/placement" class="btn-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left"></i> Back to Path Selection</a>
            </div>

            <div class="page-header">
                <h1>College & Placement Preparation</h1>
                <p>Choose between General Placement Aptitude or Practice by Company.</p>
            </div>

            <% if (disclaimer) { %>
                <div class="disclaimer-banner">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
                    <span><%= disclaimer %></span>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <div class="path-grid">
                <!-- GENERAL PLACEMENT APTITUDE -->
                <div class="path-card">
                    <div>
                        <div class="path-icon-wrapper">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>General Placement Aptitude</h2>
                        <p>Comprehensive placement practice covering Quantitative Aptitude, Logical Reasoning, Verbal Ability & Data Interpretation.</p>
                        <ul class="path-features">
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Standard campus placement structure</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 25 Questions per test</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 3 Progressive Difficulty Levels</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/placement/college/general" class="btn-primary">
                        <span>Select General Aptitude</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- PRACTICE BY COMPANY -->
                <div class="path-card">
                    <div>
                        <div class="path-icon-wrapper">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h2>Practice by Company</h2>
                        <p>Practice aptitude problem patterns associated with major recruitment drives (TCS, Infosys, Wipro, Accenture & more).</p>
                        <ul class="path-features">
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 9 Top Placement Recruiter Patterns</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Company-oriented Practice Cards</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Separate level-based question pools</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/placement/college/company" class="btn-primary">
                        <span>Explore Companies</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        <% } else if (step === 'college-general-levels') { %>
            <!-- STEP 3A: GENERAL COLLEGE LEVELS -->
            <div class="back-bar">
                <a href="/placement/college" class="btn-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left"></i> Back to College Preparation</a>
            </div>

            <div class="page-header">
                <h1>General Placement Aptitude</h1>
                <p>Select your difficulty level to attempt a 25-question mixed placement test.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="level-grid">
                <% levels.forEach(function(lvl) { %>
                    <div class="level-card <%= lvl.unlocked ? '' : 'locked' %>">
                        <div>
                            <div class="level-badge <%= lvl.unlocked ? 'unlocked' : 'locked-tag' %>">
                                <i class="fa-solid <%= lvl.unlocked ? 'fa-lock-open' : 'fa-lock' %>"></i>
                                <span><%= lvl.unlocked ? 'Unlocked' : 'Locked' %></span>
                            </div>
                            <h3><%= lvl.label.full %></h3>
                            <p><%= lvl.label.tagline %>. 25 placement questions retrieved from the Level <%= lvl.number %> general placement pool.</p>
                        </div>
                        <% if (lvl.unlocked) { %>
                            <a href="/quiz?learningPath=college&placementType=general&difficulty=<%= lvl.number %>" class="btn-primary">
                                <span>Start Level <%= lvl.number %> Test</span>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>
                            </a>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <button class="btn-secondary" disabled>
                                <span>Score <%= unlockThreshold %>% on Level <%= lvl.number - 1 %> to Unlock</span>
                            </button>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                <% }); %>
            </div>

        <% } else if (step === 'company-list') { %>
            <!-- STEP 3B: COMPANY LIST -->
            <div class="back-bar">
                <a href="/placement/college" class="btn-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left"></i> Back to College Preparation</a>
            </div>

            <div class="page-header">
                <h1>Practice by Company</h1>
                <p>Company-oriented placement practice for major hiring assessments.</p>
            </div>

            <% if (disclaimer) { %>
                <div class="disclaimer-banner">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                    <span><%= disclaimer %></span>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <div class="company-grid">
                <% companies.forEach(function(comp) { %>
                    <a href="/placement/college/company/<%= comp.slug %>" class="company-card">
                            <div class="company-header">
                            <div class="company-icon" style="background: <%= comp.logoBg %>;">
                                <i class="fa-solid <%= comp.icon %>"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="company-name"><%= comp.name %></h3>
                                <div class="company-tag"><%= comp.tag %></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <% if (comp.slug === 'cognizant') { %>
                            <p class="company-tag"><strong><%= cognizantQuestionCount || 0 %></strong> practice questions in the bank</p>
                        <% } else if (comp.slug === 'capgemini') { %>
                            <p class="company-tag"><strong><%= capgeminiQuestionCount || 0 %></strong> practice questions in the bank</p>
                        <% } else if (comp.slug === 'hcltech') { %>
                            <p class="company-tag"><strong><%= hcltechQuestionCount || 0 %></strong> practice items in the bank</p>
                        <% } else if (comp.slug === 'tech-mahindra') { %>
                            <p class="company-tag"><strong><%= techMahindraQuestionCount || 0 %></strong> objective and coding questions in the bank</p>
                        <% } else if (comp.slug === 'ibm') { %>
                            <p class="company-tag"><strong><%= ibmQuestionCount || 0 %></strong> original English and coding problems</p>
                        <% } %>
                        <div class="btn-secondary" style="padding: 10px; font-size: 13px;">
                            <span><%= comp.slug === 'accenture' ? 'Practice Accenture Patterns →' : `Practice ${comp.name} Patterns` %></span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                <% }); %>
            </div>

        <% } else if (step === 'company-levels') { %>
            <!-- STEP 4: COMPANY LEVELS -->
            <div class="back-bar">
                <a href="/placement/college/company" class="btn-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left"></i> Back to Company List</a>
            </div>

            <div class="page-header">
                <h1><%= title %></h1>
                <p><%= subtitle %></p>
            </div>

            <% if (disclaimer) { %>
                <div class="disclaimer-banner">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
                    <span><%= disclaimer %></span>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <% if (typeof isCognizant !== 'undefined' && isCognizant) { %>
                <section class="accenture-dashboard">
                    <div class="page-header">
                        <h2>Cognizant Placement Practice</h2>
                        <p>Practice communication, aptitude, technical skills and interview responses. This configurable practice pattern may be adapted to your role and hiring drive.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="level-grid">
                        <% (cognizantRounds || []).forEach(function(round, roundIndex) { %>
                            <article class="level-card">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="eyebrow">ROUND <%= roundIndex + 1 %></p>
                                    <h3><%= round.name %></h3>
                                    <p><%= round.description %></p>
                                    <p><strong><%= round.minutes %></strong> configured minutes</p>
                                    <div class="cognizant-sections">
                                        <% round.sections.forEach(function(section) { var href = section.launch === 'quiz' ? `/quiz?learningPath=college&placementType=company&company=cognizant&mode=cognizant&sectionKey=${section.key}` : `/cognizant/${section.key}`; %>
                                            <div class="cognizant-section-row">
                                                <span><strong><%= section.name %></strong><small><%= section.sessionCount %> per session · <%= section.minutes %> min<% if (section.completed) { %> · Practiced<% } %></small></span>
                                                <% if (section.available) { %><a class="btn-primary" href="<%= href %>">Practice <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><% } else { %><span class="muted">Coming soon</span><% } %>
                                            </div>
                                        <% }); %>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                        <% }); %>
                    </div>
                    <p class="disclaimer-banner">Cognizant assessment formats differ by role and recruitment drive. These are AptitudePro original practice materials, not an official or universal test pattern.</p>
                </section>

            <% } else if (typeof isAccenture !== 'undefined' && isAccenture) { %>
                <section class="accenture-dashboard">
                    <div class="page-header">
                        <h2>Accenture Placement Practice</h2>
                        <p>Practice cognitive, technical, coding and communication skills for Accenture-style assessments.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="level-grid">
                        <% (accentureSections || []).forEach(function(section) { %>
                            <article class="level-card">
                                <div>
                                    <h3><%= section.name %></h3>
                                    <p><%= section.description %></p>
                                    <p><strong><%= section.sessionCount %></strong> questions per practice session · <%= section.difficulty %></p>
                                </div>
                                <% if (section.count > 0) { %>
                                    <a class="btn-primary" href="<%= section.key === 'cognitive' || section.key === 'technical' ? `/quiz?learningPath=college&placementType=company&company=accenture&mode=accenture&sectionKey=${section.key}` : `/accenture/${section.key}` %>">
                                        <span>Practice</span><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                                    </a>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <p>Practice tasks are being prepared for this section.</p>
                                <% } %>
                            </article>
                        <% }); %>
                    </div>
                    <p class="disclaimer-banner">Assessment formats vary by role and hiring drive. Configure practice to match your invitation; this module does not claim one universal official format.</p>
                </section>

            <% } else if (typeof isCapgemini !== 'undefined' && isCapgemini) { %>
                <section class="accenture-dashboard">
                    <div class="page-header">
                        <h2>Capgemini Assessment Practice</h2>
                        <p>Configurable AptitudePro practice for technical, English, cognitive, behavioral and coding skills.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="level-grid">
                        <% (capgeminiSections || []).forEach(function(section) { %>
                            <article class="level-card">
                                <div>
                                    <h3><%= section.name %></h3>
                                    <p><%= section.description %></p>
                                    <% if (section.key === 'listening') { %>
                                        <p><%= section.sessionCount %> audio questions · <%= section.minutes %> min</p>
                                        <p class="muted">Original practice audio with a locally synthesized voice.</p>
                                    <% } else if (section.key === 'writing') { %>
                                        <p><%= section.targetCount %> writing tasks · <%= section.minutes %> min</p>
                                    <% } else if (section.key === 'games') { %>
                                        <p><%= section.targetCount %> interactive games · <%= section.minutes %> min</p>
                                    <% } else { %>
                                        <p><%= section.targetCount %> questions · <%= section.minutes %> min</p>
                                    <% } %>
                                </div>
                                <% if (section.available) { %>
                                    <% var href = section.key === 'technical' || section.key === 'english' ? `/quiz?learningPath=college&placementType=company&company=capgemini&mode=capgemini&sectionKey=${section.key}` : `/capgemini/${section.key}`; %>
                                    <a class="btn-primary" href="<%= href %>"><span>Practice</span><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <p class="muted">Practice content is being prepared for this section.</p>
                                <% } %>
                            </article>
                        <% }); %>
                    </div>
                    <p class="disclaimer-banner">These are AptitudePro practice materials, not official or leaked Capgemini questions. Hiring formats vary by role or drive. Listening uses locally synthesized audio; coding runs in an isolated sandbox.</p>
                    <p><a class="btn-secondary" href="/capgemini/history">View Capgemini practice history</a></p>
                </section>

            <% } else if (typeof isHCLTech !== 'undefined' && isHCLTech) { %>
                <section class="accenture-dashboard">
                    <div class="page-header">
                        <h2>HCLTech Placement Practice</h2>
                        <p>A fixed, timed AptitudePro practice pattern based on the configured brief. Actual HCLTech recruitment formats can vary by role and drive.</p>
                        <p><strong><%= hcltechSections.assessment.totalItems %></strong> target items · <strong><%= hcltechSections.assessment.totalMinutes %></strong> total configured minutes · no negative marking</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="level-grid">
                        <% hcltechSections.forEach(function(section) { %>
                            <article class="level-card">
                                <div>
                                    <h3><%= section.name %></h3>
                                    <p><%= section.targetCount %> questions · <%= section.minutes %> min<% if(section.completed) { %> · Practiced<% } %></p>
                                </div>
                                <% if(section.available) { %>
                                    <% var hclHref = section.key === 'coding' ? '/hcltech/coding' : `/quiz?learningPath=college&placementType=company&company=hcltech&mode=hcltech&sectionKey=${section.key}`; %>
                                    <a class="btn-primary" href="<%= hclHref %>"><span>Practice</span><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                                <% } else { %><p class="muted">Practice content is not available yet.</p><% } %>
                            </article>
                        <% }); %>
                    </div>
                    <p class="muted">Objective sessions use fixed question sets. Adaptive delivery is not enabled. These are original AptitudePro practice questions, not official HCLTech questions.</p>
                    <p><a class="btn-secondary" href="/results/history?company=HCLTech">View objective assessment history</a></p>
                    <% if(hcltechSections.codingSubmissions.length) { %><section class="level-card"><h3>Recent coding submissions</h3><ul><% hcltechSections.codingSubmissions.forEach(function(item) { %><li><a href="/hcltech/coding/result/<%= item._id %>"><%= item.testTitle %></a> · <%= item.executionAvailable ? `${item.solvedProblems}/${item.totalProblems} accepted` : 'Saved; not evaluated' %></li><% }); %></ul></section><% } %>
                </section>

            <% } else if (typeof isTechMahindra !== 'undefined' && isTechMahindra) { %>
                <section class="accenture-dashboard">
                    <div class="page-header">
                        <h2>Tech Mahindra Placement Practice</h2>
                        <p>Practice aptitude, written communication, technical foundations, coding, workplace scenarios and interview responses.</p>
                        <p class="disclaimer-banner">Configurable AptitudePro practice defaults based on a reported pattern. This is not an official, guaranteed or leaked Tech Mahindra assessment format; requirements vary by role, hiring drive and year.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="level-grid">
                        <% (techMahindraSections || []).forEach(function(section) { %>
                            <article class="level-card">
                                <div><h3><%= section.name %></h3><p><% if(section.minutes) { %><%= section.sessionCount %> questions · <%= section.minutes %> min<% } else { %><%= section.sessionCount %> questions<% } %><% if(section.completed) { %> · Practiced<% } %></p>
                                <% if (section.key === 'essay') { %><p>Choose from original topics. Word count, draft autosave, timer, and self-review are provided; there is no automatic writing score.</p><% } else if (section.key === 'psychometric') { %><p>Agreement-scale workplace reflections; not scored and not a validated personality or hiring prediction.</p><% } else if (section.key === 'communication') { %><p>Text-based accessible listening alternatives and optional local recording. No speech scoring or external audio upload.</p><% } else if(section.key === 'technicalInterview' || section.key === 'hrInterview') { %><p>Draft your own answer before revealing study guidance. Subjective answers are not graded.</p><% } else if(section.key === 'coding') { %><p>Runs through the configured isolated Judge0 sandbox when available; no execution success is fabricated.</p><% } %></div>
                                <% if(section.available) { %>
                                    <% var tmHref = ['logical','quantitative','verbal','programming','cs'].includes(section.key) ? `/quiz?learningPath=college&placementType=company&company=tech-mahindra&mode=tech-mahindra&sectionKey=${section.key}` : `/tech-mahindra/${section.routeKey}`; %>
                                    <a class="btn-primary" href="<%= tmHref %>"><span><%= section.key === 'coding' ? 'Start coding practice' : 'Start practice' %></span><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                                <% } else { %><p class="muted">Practice content is not available.</p><% } %>
                            </article>
                        <% }); %>
                    </div>
                    <p><a class="btn-secondary" href="/tech-mahindra/history">View Tech Mahindra practice history</a> <a class="btn-secondary" href="/placement/college/company">Back to companies</a></p>
